 \qquad D=(m+n)x_1^2+mn>0.
\end{equation}
Writing $\mu=mn/(m+n)$ and $d=x_1^2+\mu$, the stationary detail values are
$y_*=x_1x_2/d$ and $z_*=my_* /(m+n)$. Substitution gives
