Choose an oriented time-gauge patch
\begin{equation}
 E^0=0,\qquad E^i=e_a{}^i\,\mathrm dx^a,
 \qquad e:=\det(e_a{}^i)>0.
 \label{c:constraints:regular-triad}
\end{equation}
The positive determinant fixes the orientation and ensures invertibility. Define
\begin{equation}
